First install conda and create an environment to do this open a command terminal and input the following command.

"conda create --name Assess python=3.14" # This will create an environment for us to work in
"conda activate Assess" # This will allow us to use the environment we just made
"pip install ultralytics" # This will install the needed library to run the code

Following this you need to use the "anaconda prompt" terminal which can be found by searching in your taskbar. Once that is open type in "code" and press enter.
This will open VS Code (and open the environment within the code editor)

Open the folder attached called "Ciarans Assessment Code" in VS Code 

Now click on the python file called "Assessment Code.py"

Now run the script